          <!-- competency Overview Section -->
          <h2 class="px-3 mb-2">Competency App – Phase 1 (Microsoft Azure Cloud Platform)</h2>
          <p class="px-3 mb-4">
            This page demonstrates a cloud-deployed competency data platform built entirely on the
            <strong>Microsoft Azure technology stack</strong>.
            Employee data is retrieved from a <strong>NestJS API hosted on Azure App Service</strong>,
            backed by an <strong>Azure SQL Database</strong> populated using <strong>Azure Data Factory</strong>.
          </p>

          <!-- Technology Stack Overview -->
          <div class="tech-stack-summary px-3 mb-4 ms-2">
            <h5 class="fw-semibold mb-3">Technology Stack (Phase 1)</h5>
            <ul class="list-inline small mb-0 ms-2">
              <li class="list-inline-item mb-1">
                <strong>Frontend:</strong> HTML, EJS, JavaScript, Bootstrap 5, jQuery, DataTables
              </li><br>
              <li class="list-inline-item mb-1">
                <strong>Backend API:</strong> NestJS (Node.js, TypeScript), TypeORM — deployed to Azure App Service
              </li><br>
              <li class="list-inline-item mb-1">
                <strong>Data Platform:</strong> Azure SQL Database, Azure Data Factory, Azure Blob Storage
              </li><br>
              <li class="list-inline-item">
                <strong>Cloud & DevOps:</strong> Azure App Service (Linux), GitHub Actions (CI/CD)
              </li>
            </ul>
          </div>

          <p class="small text-muted ms-3 mt-2">
            Phase 1 focuses on cloud deployment, data ingestion, and API integration.
          </p>

          <div class="accordion" id="competencyappAccordion">
            <!-- Overview -->
            <div class="accordion-item">
              <h2 class="accordion-header" id="competencyappHeadingOne">
                <button class="accordion-button" type="button" data-bs-toggle="collapse"
                  data-bs-target="#competencyappCollapseOne" aria-expanded="true"
                  aria-controls="competencyappCollapseOne">
                  About the Project
                </button>
              </h2>
              <div id="competencyappCollapseOne" class="accordion-collapse collapse show" 
                aria-labelledby="competencyappHeadingOne" data-bs-parent="#competencyappAccordion">
                <div class="accordion-body">
                  <p>
                    The <strong>Competency App</strong> is a full-stack web application designed to
                    demonstrate practical experience with <strong>Microsoft Azure cloud services</strong>
                    and modern backend development.
                  </p>

                  <p>
                    Phase 1 focuses on deploying a production-style data pipeline and API, rather than
                    advanced user interface features. Employee competency and experience data is ingested,
                    stored, and exposed via a secure REST API, then consumed by a lightweight frontend for
                    exploration and validation.
                  </p>

                  <p>
                    Key objectives of this phase include:
                  </p>

                  <ul>
                    <li>Deploying a scalable <strong>NestJS API</strong> to Azure App Service</li>
                    <li>Integrating with <strong>Azure SQL Database</strong> using TypeORM</li>
                    <li>Ingesting structured data via <strong>Azure Data Factory</strong></li>
                    <li>Demonstrating secure, cross-origin (CORS) access from a separate frontend application</li>
                  </ul>

                  <p class="mb-0">
                    Subsequent phases extend this foundation with richer frontend interaction,
                    search, and analytics features.
                  </p>

                </div>
              </div>
            </div>

